Skip(1).Take(2) 之后 CountAsync = 2，全表 = 5（分页那两颗粒留在内层：SELECT "t0"."Id", "t0"."CustomerId", "t0"."Amount", "t0"."CreatedAt", "t0"."Note" FROM "Orders" AS "t0" ORDER BY "t0"."Id" ASC LIMIT 2 OFFSET 1）
WithSql 外层由库写：SELECT "t0"."Id", "t0"."CustomerId", "t0"."Amount", "t0"."CreatedAt", "t0"."Note" FROM (SELECT * FROM Orders WHERE CustomerId = 5) AS "t0" WHERE "t0"."Amount" >= CAST('200' AS NUMERIC) ORDER BY "t0"."Id" ASC
  读回 2 行，其中最大单笔 300
派生表套原生源：SELECT "t0"."Id", "t0"."Name", "t0"."City" FROM "Customers" AS "t0" WHERE (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM (SELECT * FROM Orders WHERE CustomerId = 5) AS "t1004" WHERE "t1004"."Amount" >= CAST('200' AS NUMERIC)) > 0

═══ 11. 批量高速层 ═══

Auto 取到的层：MultiValue ∶ 500 行 / 23 次往返 / 每块 22 行
  为什么：500 行 × 4 列，参数预算 100 → 每块 22 行（23 块），L3 多值语句。
请求 CopyChannel 实际走了 MultiValue（Degraded=True），留痕 1 次：CopyChannel → MultiValue
  Never 拦下了：请求了 Sqlite 的装载通道而它不可用：Sqlite 没有可用的装载通道（IBulkStrategy.ResolveCopyChannel() 交回 null：这一家没接，或这一支驱动里没有装载类）。FallbackPolicy.Never 不允许退回文本层。
  行数出口拒了：ExecuteAffrowsAsync 走不了 CopyChannel：那一档要的是「走了哪一层、几次往返、为什么」，而它的返回值只是一颗行数。装载通道请用 ExecuteBulkAsync；只压每块行数或按请求逐条请用 WithBulk(MultiValue/SingleRow, rowsPerRoundTrip: …)。
压到每块 20 行：25 次往返、每块 20 行
库里读回 1000 行 Note=bulk-layer

